 * Add an rx vlan identifier
 *//*
 * Kill (i.e. delete) a vlan identifier.
 *//* IEEE80211_VLAN_TAG_USED *//* IEEE80211_VLAN_TAG_USED *//* fire off wireless event station leaving *//* dispatch wireless event indicating scan completed *//* TODO: needed parameters: count, keyid, key type, src address, TSC *//**
 * Entry point for reporting of MIC failure (via ic pointer).
 *//* If more than two errors, only report the first two as this
	 * will be enough to trigger countermeasures.
	 *//* Send up to 2 reports *//* Format a frame header appropriately for a MIC report *//* TODO: needed parameters: count, keyid, key type, src address, TSC *//* qtn=1 is used (in conjunction with userspace hostapd change) to ensure that the
