		 * NON-ZERO association ID (ie no temporary nodes)
		 *///IEEE80211_NODE_UNLOCK(nt);/* initially allocate both read and write buffers *//* now read the data into the buffer *//* IEEE80211_DEBUG *//* cannot be CTL_ANY or CTL_NONE *//* NB: must be last entry before NULL *//*
	 * Reserve space for the device name outside the net_device structure
