		 * extraneous stuff).
		 *//* active *///struct ieee80211_node *ni = vap->iv_bss;/* XXX stack usage? *//* txpower (128 values, but will print out only IW_MAX_TXPOWER) *//* discard if previously reported (e.g. b/g) *//* Supported channels count *//* Atheros' RSSI value is SNR: 0 -> 60 for old chipsets. Range
