	 *//* We ran out of space in the buffer *//* We ran out of space in the buffer. *//* NB: not sorted, does it matter? *//* Copy HT rates *//* 80+80 or 160 Mhz *//* Copy HT rates *//* remove fixed header if no rates were added *//* We ran out of space in the buffer. *//* We ran out of space in the buffer. *//* We ran out of space in the buffer. *//* We ran out of space in the buffer *//* We ran out of space in the buffer. *//* We ran out of space in the buffer. *//* We ran out of space in the buffer. *//* We ran out of space in the buffer. *//* We ran out of space in the buffer. *//* We ran out of space in the buffer. *//*
