	 *//* SIOCGIWSCAN *//* NB: need to order longest strings first for overlaps *//* convert user-specified string to upper case *//* silently truncate *//* ensure null termination *//* We demux - one message is "WPA-PORT-ENABLE", the rest should be pushed
	 * via wireless_send_event.
	 *//* In this case, we assume the message from userspace has the correct format *//*
 * Blacklist a station that is in the hostapd MAC filtering list.
 *//* Corner case - can't use zero! *//* This status is only used internally, for blacklisting *//*
		 * Ensure that the deauth/disassoc frame is sent
