		*//* Send deauth frame before switching channel *//* We cannot call with the parent device, needs to be the VAP device *//* Updating bandwidth base on mode *//* Updating all mode related flags *//* Switch channel according to Edge+/- Cntr +/- *//* Function attached to the iwpriv wifi0 forcesmps call. *//* Ensure we only apply valid values to the local vap state *//* If we're a STA, send out an ACTION frame to change our SMPS mode *//* See 802.11n d11.0 section 7.3.1.22 for the formatting of the HT ACTION SMPS byte. *///Contain the single byte for the SMPS action frame in the param field/*
 * Check if a node is blacklisted.
