				compound_cca_intf = ieee80211_scs_fix_cca_intf(ic, NULL, scan_info.cca_intf,
						scan_info.spre_err, scan_info.lpre_err);
				*//* clear initial channel ranking table *//* When request is because of interference *//* don't clear dfs reentry and wait for next interval result *//* Copy scs info into a local structure so MuC can continue fill it *//* make sure cross channel switching stats are cleared *//* Read and process off channel stats *//* Scale co-channel data *//* update smoothed free airtime *//* clear current cca intf at first *//* update cca intf stats *//* update tx/rx time stats *//*
			 * Pick a channel from DFS and Non-DFS set of channels;
			 * Consider channel margins as well while we pick the channel
			 *//* In RBS mode - inform the MBS AP to change the channel *//* WDS Link to MBS? *//* here replace the old csa mgmt packet sending*//* In STA mode - inform AP to change the channel *//* STA should be associated *//* here replace the old csa mgmt packet sending*//*
		 * Pick a channel from DFS and Non-DFS sets;
