		 * If the picked channel is DFS, OCAC will not kickin
		 *//* CCA information cannot match a certain channel under scan state *//* Copy scs info into a local structure so MuC can continue to fill it in *//* SCS off channel sampling follows SCS *//* CCA information cannot match a certain channel under scan state *//* Copy scs info into a local structure so MuC can continue to fill it in *//* the ranking table *//* For the scoring, the algorithm as below:
	 *   1. For the channel which has the minimum valid metric, the score is 100
	 *   2. For the channel which has the maximum valid metric, the score is 0
