	 *//* when in auto channel scanning *//* the ranking table *//* WAR for bug16636, supposed to be removed after cca threshold re-tuned *//* QSCS_ENABLED *//* QTN_BG_SCAN *//* QTN_BG_SCAN *//* 80+80 or 160 Mhz *//* Copy HT rates *//* check length, set macaddr, ssid, channel, rssi, flags,htcap*//* ap mac addr *//* ssid *//* channel ieee *//* max bandwidth *//* rssi *//* flags:privacy *//* htcap available *//* vhtcap available *//* check length, copy wpa_ie, wsc_ie and rsn_ie to buffer if exist *//* keep address 4-byte aligned*//* get bit rates from ic->ic_sup_rates[ic->ic_des_mode] *//* Skip legacy rates *//* initialize ap_scan_iter *//*
